<description>&lt;p&gt;Nicolás Maduro and his wife again pleaded not guilty to U.S. conspiracy to torture charges in New York, while the United States lifted sanctions on Jorge Rodríguez, head of Venezuela's National Assembly. The U.S. Space Force deployed electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela, mirroring similar actions in Iran. EnergyNow reports that global shipping disruptions and Venezuelan supply pressure have widened the Alberta heavy oil discount to over $25 per barrel. In Chile, a Venezuelan gang member was sentenced to 20 years for kidnapping and killing a dissident. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPSm53RDlpSVFXRjkzV1pJTkIyYlRzeFptSU1ManNGYXJnRFdmNFo2OGFOdjVxQU9UcDNmbllWMzFmbmJNV2tEc1UwQy1rWU5CYmJURnZkaUF1c1Y4UXAzV2JZNmdPdnhYcENsYmh0bXRJLTBTNFNGWUl4QjZKOHJ3QzhuZmtvcWplbGN3OVVaQXNmdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOQVZ3VzZsQTJMSnlVV1QwemJZSjRBY0JrWTdBbGg4VmhMbG8tZzRDOHhRU01NOWJCV25Iem05S1BqanZjbDdray1rNUFYOTBKZS0xT2R5UTVUeHE3N0FvVmppUU5Dem5SUXZQb3hYYXhNekdPRjVMVEdEMFpMUGk1MjZJZGZtNlUwSzgtN25FM0ZtRG9NVzJUWGtWU0djQTBiYkY1Q20xSzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQVXFnM3A0T3lJeVdPVnZrVlZHT3l6dlBUbjZkZGdmYTd4NTFkZEE1TkpOVkNxaXpoZVBiQUNSNWhrRGl4cXZxS2VWeHN5aVVfbEpSR2doM0xwR1JiZHA5VjdkLVhrVHhBMTlNQmQ1ZGNOSGd1bDhFOEFFQlpveFRpcG43MUZ1OEwwWGxqeXFrLUNwakUxOTU5R19rZEFTQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE5jZXVaZzY0X0o4dHNxU0dMQ0RnOVo2N1hULVM2TkY5